* ``unresolved_kpis``: any optimisation-target KPI that no grounded   modification can address — with a concrete reason. Prefer this over   fabricating a weakly-grounded modification. A KPI must be in exactly   one of ``modifications`` or ``unresolved_kpis``, never both.
